cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "Residential greenness and pulmonary fungal infections: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  R code reproducing the tables and figures of the manuscript examining
  associations between residential greenness (NDVI, EVI at 250, 500 and 1000 m)
  and pulmonary fungal infections in a 1:3 propensity-score-matched
  case-control study.
